What is it?
===========

This is a door whereby online users can search through the DoT TraderList
and view a listing of ELITE BBS's sorted by either COUNTRY or GROUP.



How do I install it?
====================

Simply copy the files to the correct paths, no configuring is needed!

TLIST.info        goes in the BBS:commands/bbscmd/
TLIST.x           goes in the BBS:doors/phidoors/

and move the TLIST directory (containing the txt files and menus) to:
                  BBS:tlist

So you should now have a dir called BBS:tlist containing the txt files.



About this Door
===============

The idea for this door came by just my wanting to release SOMETHING that
would bring some sort of RECOGNITION to my new board.  So I began working
on the Dead On Time TraderList, which I planned to spread once per month
with as many updates as possible.  Then I began to learn E programming,
cuz I was pushed by GI JOE, so the TLIST door was born!  Actually, the
code is VERY SIMPLE.  I just learned enough commands to get it to work!
Now as I learn more, my doors u will see get better!

Now, I have heard the complaint that the spreading of 'traderlists' does
damage to the scene because organizations such as FAST or the SPA can get
ahold of them and use them to more easily bring down elite boards.  I
know that this is a danger.  The reason I am still spreading this is
because I think that they have more than enough information at their
disposal anyway.  I believe that they can release a more 'up to date'
traderlist than I can, ANYDAY.  However, if enough people feel that I am
hurting the scene with this, then I will gladly STOP.  As with giving
edits and additions to the list, you must contact me at any SRH bbs!!!



